  merchantTextLines:
  - "Hah\u2026 You held your ground. The dark <wave a=.2 f=1.5>hates</wave> persistence."
  - "You\u2019ve earned your place here. <wiggle a=.05 f=2>The Lost Greens</wiggle>
    will remember you."
  - "The emberlings are yours to shape. <slide a=.2>Bring them to me</slide>, and
    I\u2019ll make them last."
  - "Heh\u2026 Even the little one knows. <wave a=.2 f=1.5>The nights only get darker</wave>."
  showShopAfterDialog: 0
